    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the spotlight of a deadly spectacle \u2014 welcome to The Beautiful Life Show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror action-adventure crafted in side-scrolling, old-school fashion, this game thrusts you into the starring role of a bizarre and unforgiving performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your stage? A nightmarish theater of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the experience lies the innovative Death-Sense Action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When death claims you, time rewinds\u2014just three seconds back, but enough to rewrite fate. Collaborate with the ghost of your former self, reliving your final moments in tandem to outwit traps, overcome foes, and press onward into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you endure to the final curtain\u2014and dare to peer into the abyss that lies beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259730/extras/3d53713eac3d6d267de76e083654927d.poster.avif?t=1754041229\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259730/extras/3d53713eac3d6d267de76e083654927d.webm?t=1754041229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259730/extras/3d53713eac3d6d267de76e083654927d.mp4?t=1754041229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the spotlight of a deadly spectacle \u2014 welcome to The Beautiful Life Show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror action-adventure crafted in side-scrolling, old-school fashion, this game thrusts you into the starring role of a bizarre and unforgiving performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your stage? A nightmarish theater of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the experience lies the innovative Death-Sense Action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When death claims you, time rewinds\u2014just three seconds back, but enough to rewrite fate. Collaborate with the ghost of your former self, reliving your final moments in tandem to outwit traps, overcome foes, and press onward into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you endure to the final curtain\u2014and dare to peer into the abyss that lies beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259730/extras/3d53713eac3d6d267de76e083654927d.poster.avif?t=1754041229\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259730/extras/3d53713eac3d6d267de76e083654927d.webm?t=1754041229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259730/extras/3d53713eac3d6d267de76e083654927d.mp4?t=1754041229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
